) -> Int
contract {
  intent { "MR3 one-way arena state transition. Ops 0 has 1 status 2 epoch 3 use 4 put 5 dispose 6 lease, else 11. State 0 Active 1 Quarantined 2 Disposed 3 Partial, else 11. Disposed is final. Dispose of any listed state is Disposed. Partial is never Active again. 106 117 121 139 140 quarantine (a malformed or wrong-length epoch frame quarantines; an epoch moving backwards quarantines). 141 is Disposed. Known benign codes keep state. Any unknown packed code quarantines (fail closed). Quarantine is never undone." }
